\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Gate decisions. (a) Direction: fused where network and geometry agree within their combined uncertainty, geometry where they clearly disagree, network otherwise; without geometry, v4 holds the last gated direction once the network is distrusted. (b) Length: the accelerometer where its window is observable, the network elsewhere. Rotation always comes from the gyroscope. v3 uses a fixed $\sigma _{\mathrm  {net}}=0.83^\circ $; v4 replaces it by the online $\hat  \sigma $.}}{4}{figure.3}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:gate}{{3}{4}{Gate decisions. (a) Direction: fused where network and geometry agree within their combined uncertainty, geometry where they clearly disagree, network otherwise; without geometry, v4 holds the last gated direction once the network is distrusted. (b) Length: the accelerometer where its window is observable, the network elsewhere. Rotation always comes from the gyroscope. v3 uses a fixed $\sigma _{\mathrm {net}}=0.83^\circ $; v4 replaces it by the online $\hat \sigma $}{figure.3}{}}
